# EPIC-009 — Obsessive Craftsmanship

Full spec: `docs/EPIC-009.md`

Master craftsman pass — search for **missed opportunities**, not missing features.

## Craftsman test

*One more hour on this component — meaningfully better?* Yes → improve. No → protect.

## Five senses

Weight · Depth · Texture · Temperature · Silence — let these guide refinements.

## Avoid / Pursue

Avoid: noise, artificial luxury, trend-chasing · Pursue: precision, restraint, balance, timelessness

## Systems

`ChamberWaitingOrb` · `OraclySnackBar` · `OraclyDialog` · signature press · canonical glass — never raw Material on visible paths

## Final question

Next to the finest digital products — would anything reveal less care? Refine only that.

## Success

Nothing feels neglected. Every detail says: *someone truly cared.*
